            "action_name": {
              "value": "Sniper's Devastation"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The shobhad sniper makes a fist Strike against a Medium or smaller creature. If this attack is successful, the shobhad sniper deals no damage, but they immediately Grab and throw their target up to 30 feet in a direction of their choice and then make a ranged Strike with their longrifle against the target, after which the target falls prone in the designated location.\n\nAs normal, the creature doesn't take any additional falling damage from the throw."
